  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Recruit 27,500 nurses and 4,600 doctors; end charges for long‑term personal care; reduce/abolish prescription charges; Patient Care Guarantees; ban age discrimination; abolish university tuition fees and restore grants for the poorest; create an Equality Act and Commission and repeal Section 28; free off‑peak bus travel for pensioners/disabled; humane, faster asylum and end vouchers; strengthen victims’ rights and tackle hate crime; raise basic pension and extend Winter Fuel Payment; apply full minimum wage rate from age 16. TEXT_C: Repeal the European Communities Act, keep the pound, and oppose EU government/army/constitution; deterrent sentencing with “life means life” and 25,000 more police; immigration policy set solely by the UK with skills‑based admissions; simplify benefits so work always pays; decentralise NHS and raise nurse pay; support selection/streaming and consider vouchers; oppose the EU Charter of Fundamental Rights and enact a sovereignty‑locking Bill of Rights.",
